  "description": "Feel the pull, not the struggle.Top-tier ebike performance at an unbeatable price.\n\n2800W peak output and 240Nm torque for instant 33MPH-—conquer 40° hills effortlessly. Powerful and stable for city commuting or travel cycling.\n\nSimple, gearless design for a quiet, vibration-free ride—so you can enjoy the sounds of nature, not the motor\n\nExtra shock absorbing: buttery smooth on any gnarly terrain.\n\nUltra-plush, oversized cushioning that delivers a cloud-like feel and eliminates pressure on long rides.\n\nAdjustable seatpost with a built-in spring that adds a \"cushion of air\" to every bump.\n\nSGS certified power with three-sided external protection.\n\nMassive 3640Wh automotive-grade power center: built for 3000+ cycles to keep you exploring for a decade.\n\nMilitary-grade aluminum armor to shield your power source from heavy impacts.\n\nBrutally tested to global safety standards so you can ride with zero worries.\n\nNo more \"mushy\" feel—get immediate stopping power the second you squeeze.\n\nReinforced with a tough outer wrap to prevent line bursts and shielding against sharp debris.\n\nSuper fast cooling for reliable stopping even at 33MPH speeds.\n\nEliminate wrist pain and spine-jarring bumps when riding over potholes or curbs.\n\nDual-crown hydraulic suspension that swallows massive hits while keeping your front end locked on track.\n\nHeavy-duty rear spring designed to cushion big bumps and keep your ride smooth on any trail.",
